        <item>
            <title>1.0.51</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Send with ⌘Return.</strong> The shortcut is now listed in the Message menu as <strong>Send</strong>, so it's easy to find. Press ⌘Return in any message you're writing to send it. You still get the usual few seconds to undo.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
